  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vignette-removed/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/For MC_403272_all.svg\" width=\"618\" height=\"18\"></a><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/gwzpyQb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/525232025355943956?color=g&amp;label=加入 TNP Discord 伺服器\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br>暗角效果是指使畫面邊緣或角落變暗的視覺效果。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在黑暗空間或地獄中，暗角效果最為明顯，有時會令人感到困擾。<br><br>（此資源包同時也會移除紅色世界邊界色調！）<br><br>點擊下方連結查看對比圖，您可以看到開啟與關閉暗角效果的差異。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.knightlab.com%252flibs%252fjuxtapose%252flatest%252fembed%252findex.html%253fuid%253d8027fbc2-e30b-11ea-bf88-a15b6c7adf9a\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn.knightlab.com/libs/juxtapose/latest/embed/index.html?uid=8027fbc2-e30b-11ea-bf88-a15b6c7adf9a</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/gbergz?r=CurseForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/8fbca32c-d963-4b25-b54b-baf6a21b10a7.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"106\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vignette-removed/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O4j2o17.png\" width=\"635\" height=\"171\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">↑（這是經過誇張化處理的對比圖，但展示了此資源包的實際效果）↑</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/siFhF5X.png\"></p>",
